      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در بارداری منع مصرف دارد.",
        "en": "Label: contraindicated in pregnancy."
      },
      "quote": "Two published cases of conjoined twins have been reported in patients taking griseofulvin during the first trimester of pregnancy, therefore, griseofulvin is contraindicated in women who are or may become pregnant during treatment.",
